rows.abstract:
Proposes to require that the pertinent regulatory authority first certifies that no other local contractor can undertake a certain project before a foreign entity may be granted license to operate in the Philippines;
Intends to regulate the entry of foreign - owned construction companies by requiring them to prove that they are amply qualified with the requisite experience and knowledge of Philippine laws and rudimentary administrative principles; 
Seeks to grant the regulatory authority sufficient latitude to investigate, classify and qualify applicants for contractor´s licenses by written or oral examination, or both.
